WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.500
Trace in your browser: replay probe seven.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:10.275
Open the replay theater. No backend, no signup: the map loads from static files.

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:15.250
Guided: four of ten. Flat spends its budget and blanks.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:21.775
Sixteen below half. Probe eighty-three: flat wins. Misses stay on screen.

00:00:23.575 --> 00:00:27.250
Every frame is a link. Copy the hash, send the replay.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:31.350
Kill the network. The replay still runs.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:36.700
Reproduce it locally: one command prints probe seven's row.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:41.875
Touch the real map.  Then verify it.
